# Normalise line endings: the repo stores LF, checkouts adapt per platform.
# Without this a Windows clone gets CRLF, and `pnpm format:check` (Prettier
# defaults to LF) fails in CI before a contributor changes anything.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish files git should never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
